---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { AUTHOR, PUBLISHER, SITE_URL } from '../config';
---
<Base title="Colophon" description="Production notes for Knowware.">
  <section class="kw-section">
    <p class="kw-label">Colophon</p>
    <h1 class="kw-h2">How it was made.</h1>
  </section>

  <section class="kw-section colophon-body">
    <h2 class="kw-h3">The work</h2>
    <p class="kw-body">
      <em>Knowware: Systems of Intelligence</em> is a book in the form of a structured intelligence synthesis. Nine chapters. 81 voices. One argument: that coordination, not computation, is the defining problem of our moment.
    </p>
    <p class="kw-body" style="margin-top:16px">
      Written and constructed by {AUTHOR}. Published by {PUBLISHER}.
    </p>

    <h2 class="kw-h3" style="margin-top:40px">The site</h2>
    <p class="kw-body">
      Built with Astro — fully prerendered, zero client-side frameworks, no tracking.
      Typography: JetBrains Mono (monospace), Helvetica Neue (display/body).
      Palette: navy <code>#191938</code>, cream <code>#EDEEE4</code>, signal <code>#2F55E0</code>.
    </p>
    <p class="kw-body" style="margin-top:16px">
      The bar-field that appears on the cover and throughout the site is a generative CSS rendering of the physical book's printed field — two <code>repeating-linear-gradient</code>s, no images.
      The signal line (blue) draws in on load via a single CSS animation.
    </p>

    <h2 class="kw-h3" style="margin-top:40px">Third-party resources</h2>
    <p class="kw-body">
      Google Fonts (JetBrains Mono, Inter) — loaded via <code>font-display: swap</code>, no tracking pixel.
      No analytics. No cookies. No share pixels. Sharing uses <code>navigator.share</code> and clipboard API only.
    </p>

    <h2 class="kw-h3" style="margin-top:40px">The 82nd line</h2>
    <p class="kw-body">
      Readers who contribute a named voice before the deadline receive a permanent credit line in the colophon and an acknowledgement in the book's back matter.
      <a href="/contribute" style="color:var(--accent);border-bottom:1px solid var(--accent)">Contribute a voice →</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
.colophon-body { max-width: 680px; }
code {
  font-family: "JetBrains Mono", ui-monospace, monospace;
  font-size: 0.88em;
  background: var(--accent-soft);
  padding: 2px 5px;
}
</style>
